    {
      "name": "The \"Glucose Goddess\" Hack, Explained",
      "char_file": "흰쌀밥_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "You've probably seen",
        "\"eat in this order\" hacks",
        "all over TikTok",
        "",
        "It's not just a trend —",
        "there's real clinical",
        "research behind why",
        "the order matters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "What Weill Cornell Found",
      "char_file": "혈당계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Dr. Alpana Shukla's team",
        "tested this in people",
        "with type 2 diabetes",
        "",
        "Same meal, veggies and",
        "protein first — spikes",
        "dropped by up to 40%",
        "vs. eating carbs first"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Step One: Vegetables First",
      "char_file": "샐러드_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Start with a salad or",
        "non-starchy vegetables",
        "",
        "Fiber slows how fast",
        "your stomach empties",
        "into your small intestine"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Step Two: Protein Next",
      "char_file": "계란_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Move on to protein —",
        "eggs, chicken, fish,",
        "or tofu",
        "",
        "It digests slowly too,",
        "and keeps you full",
        "longer than carbs alone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Step Three: Carbs Last",
      "char_file": "흰쌀밥_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Save bread, rice, or",
        "pasta for last",
        "",
        "Same meal, same",
        "portions — just a",
        "much gentler glucose rise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "If You're On Diabetes Medication",
      "char_file": "알약_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "This eating order",
        "doesn't replace medication",
        "",
        "If you're managing diabetes,",
        "talk to your doctor before",
        "changing how you eat"
      ]
    }
  ],
